            "text": "You can log in to **My Service Canada Account (MSCA)** on the official Government of Canada page:\n\n**Go to:** Canada.ca \u2192 **My Service Canada Account (MSCA)** ([canada.ca](https://www.canada.ca/myservicecanadaaccount?utm_source=openai))\n\nSign-in options include:\n\n- **Interac\u00ae Sign-In Partner** \u2014 use your online banking login\n- **GCKey** \u2014 Government of Canada username and password\n- **Provincial sign-in** \u2014 available for **BC and Alberta** ([canada.ca](https://www.canada.ca/myservicecanadaaccount?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Tip:** Use the same sign-in method you used when you created the account, because it\u2019s tied to your MSCA profile. ([canada.ca](https://www.canada.ca/myservicecanadaaccount?utm_source=openai))\n\nFor safety, make sure the page is on **canada.ca** before entering any personal information.",
